?C: diplomatic answer
~ 30
D: back. did the paladin win the argument | ok back, what happened, did twisting win
E: nobody won, paladins are still underrated and minstrels still have headaches
A: honestly i think i will roll one, i like the idea of the glue class | sold. i want to be the glue of a group
B: macro your chants and practice on greys first | tip: practice twisting on greens before you try it in a real group
C: and get a keyboard with good keys | buy a keyboard you will not break
?E: a paladin and a minstrel twisting in the same group must sound like a parade
C: a very organized parade | the loudest parade in camelot

@topic melee_choice
@levels 20-50
@scene alb_merc_reaver_arms
@role B class=Mercenary
@role C class=Reaver
@role D class=Armsman
@role E type=Explorer
A: rolling a new fighter tonight. merc, reaver or armsman, sell me | which melee should a new alb try, merc reaver or arms
B: merc. two weapons, evade, everything happens fast | mercenary, dual wield is the most fun you will have hitting things
C: reaver. a flail, soulrending, and enemies who never know what hit them | reaver, the shrouded isles class with the strangest tricks
D: armsman. plate armor and every weapon. the safe choice for a reason
B: safe means boring
D: safe means alive at the end of the fight | safe means i am still standing when the merc is at the bind
~ 25
C: and reavers steal a little life back with every fight | soulrending keeps me topped up longer than you would think
B: you steal a little and lose a lot to anyone who knows what you are doing
C: most people do not know what a reaver does yet, that is half the fun | half the enemy still has no idea how to fight a reaver, i enjoy that
?E: i saw my first reaver in avalon last week, thought it was a monster | first reaver i met in avalon i almost attacked by mistake
C: we get that a lot
~ 30
A: which one is easiest to get a group with?
D: armsman, everyone wants a plate tank | armsman. plate gets invites, simple as that
B: merc gets invites when the group already has a tank | a merc gets the second melee slot in nearly every group
C: reaver gets invites when the group leader is curious | reavers get invites from adventurous group leaders
?E: and explorers like me invite whoever looks the strangest
A: that settles it honestly. armsman main, reaver alt for fun | ok, armsman first. reaver as the alt when i want weird
D: smart. you can always make the merc third
B: the merc will remember this | wow, nobody picks the merc. we will see who laughs in the frontier
~ 20
C: see you in avalon little reaver alt | find me in avalon when the alt is ready, i will show you the ropes
A: will do, ty all
B: still should have been merc

